    "title": "Gigastone 128GB Micro SD Card",
    "description": "The <b>Gigastone 128GB Micro SD Card (GS-4KA2V60-128G)</b> delivers top-tier speed, durability, and performance for professionals and creators alike. With <b>V60 speed grade</b> and <b>A2 app performance</b>, it supports <b>Ultra HD 4K video recording, mobile gaming,</b> and <b>high-speed file transfers</b> without lag. Ideal for expanding storage on <b>smartphones, tablets, cameras, drones, and laptops</b>, this micro SD card ensures quick access and smooth playback. Its robust design withstands extreme conditions, while Gigastone’s 5-year limited warranty and free data recovery provide long-term peace of mind. Whether you're capturing breathtaking footage, running apps, or storing large media libraries, the <b>Gigastone V60 128GB Micro SD Card</b> delivers reliable, high-performance storage you can count on.",
